{"id":"6587ae27f7ed289f","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-hyperarithmetical-def.md","title":"Effective Hyperarithmetical Jump System","display":"df-hyperarithmetical-def — Effective Hyperarithmetical Jump System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def","aliases":["88-df-hyperarithmetical-def"],"display":"df-hyperarithmetical-def — Effective Hyperarithmetical Jump System","depends_on":["[[88-df-ordinal-notation]]","[[88-df-effective-program-numbering]]","[[88-df-jump-operator-def]]","[[88-df-effective-join]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-hyperarithmetical-def"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-hyperarithmetical-def</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperarithmetical-def — Effective Hyperarithmetical Jump System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_{88},&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\">\\(\\mathcal O_{88},&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b23177f17eeaa7a2\" href=\"?note=b23177f17eeaa7a2\" title=\"88-df-ordinal-notation\">88-df-ordinal-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_e\">\\(\\varphi_e\\)</span> 使用其固定编号，与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b955b7851c500bfe\" href=\"?note=b955b7851c500bfe\" title=\"88-df-effective-program-numbering\">88-df-effective-program-numbering</a> 的一元记号相同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(J:\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c749f46fbad31f8b\" href=\"?note=c749f46fbad31f8b\" title=\"88-df-jump-operator-def\">88-df-jump-operator-def</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k\">\\(\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}A_k\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"20e88b72affa35d1\" href=\"?note=20e88b72affa35d1\" title=\"88-df-effective-join\">88-df-effective-join</a> 中用固定编码定义的有效直和，不能解释成普通并集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> 为候选集合值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\)</span> 是本文件定义的递归子句谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal H:\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathcal H(1)=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n\\mathcal H(2^a)=J(\\mathcal H(a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq\\mathcal O_{88}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e(k)&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\varphi_e(k+1)\n\\land\\mathcal H(3\\cdot5^e)=\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal H(\\varphi_e(k))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical\\text{-}def}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{HyperJumpSys}_{88}(\\mathcal H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal H:\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\n\\land\\mathcal H(1)=\\emptyset\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\;\n\\mathcal H(2^a)=J(\\mathcal H(a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(3\\cdot5^e\\in\\mathcal O_{88}\\to\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_e)=\\mathbb N\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\varphi_e)\\subseteq\\mathcal O_{88}\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{3em}{}\\land\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\varphi_e(k)&lt;_{\\mathcal O_{88}}\\varphi_e(k+1)\n\\land\\mathcal H(3\\cdot5^e)=\\bigoplus_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathcal H(\\varphi_e(k))\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>极限分支的序列是该记号携带的总可计算严格递增序列，不能对抽象极限序数另选未编码的基本序列。直和保留序列的列号；它的定义来源已进入元数据和假设。</p>\n<p>这里仅定义“满足递归子句”的性质。系统存在唯一性由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5e3111fd9385df4f\" href=\"?note=5e3111fd9385df4f\" title=\"88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence\">88-lem-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy-existence</a> 证明，具体层 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span> 由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"ca39023cb294c484\" href=\"?note=ca39023cb294c484\" title=\"88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy\">88-df-hyperarithmetical-hierarchy</a> 引入。名称中的 jump system 指普通图灵跳跃的超限迭代，不是通常也称 hyperjump 的 Kleene <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span> 相对化算子。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","tex